# Ro'Maeve (Zilart 9, mission.zilart.romaeve): Lower Jeuno's Aldo plays 84 while the Option var is 0, whose
# finish sets Mission[3][18]Option to 1; then he plays 24. Norg's _700 plays 3; its finish on option 1 does
# nothing, on option 0 completes the mission (no key item, no title; the Option var deleted; The Temple of
# Desolation current). Then _700 plays 5 (10_The_Temple_of_Desolation's reply).
lists LowerJeuno/Aldo/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/84 Norg/_700/onTrigger Norg/onEventFinish/3
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=23,3,-58 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart Romaeve current
login
trigger Aldo                            # Option 0: 84
finish                                  # Option set to 1
trigger Aldo                            # Option 1: 24
finish
warp 98,-7,-12 Norg
trigger _700                            # 3
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger _700                            # 3
finish option=0                         # completed
trigger _700                            # The Temple of Desolation current: its 5
finish-if-event
